Add these dev-dependencies to `fri/Cargo.toml` at Plonky3 commit
`a31a1443a114c58735850daa5b5fc5c43c138d9d`:

```toml
p3-koala-bear = { path = "../koala-bear" }
p3-maybe-rayon = { path = "../maybe-rayon", features = ["parallel"] }
```

The direct `p3-maybe-rayon` dev-dependency enables Rayon consistently for the
DFT and Merkle crates through Cargo feature unification.
